---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Quantum Mechanics Cheat Sheet | Free Wave Function, Operators, Measurement"
  description="Complete quantum mechanics cheat sheet with wave function, operators, and measurement. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Quantum Mechanics<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Wave function, operators, and measurement. From Schrodinger to Dirac notation.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Wave Function</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Schrodinger Equation</h3>
        <pre><code>iℏ ∂Ψ/∂t = ĤΨ
Time-dependent: iℏ ∂Ψ/∂t = [-ℏ²/(2m)∇² + V]Ψ
Time-independent: Ĥψ = Eψ</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Normalization</h3>
        <pre><code>∫|Ψ|²d³r = 1
Probability density: ρ = |Ψ|²
Probability current: j = (ℏ/2mi)(Ψ*∇Ψ - Ψ∇Ψ*)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Operators</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Common Operators</h3>
        <pre><code>Position: x̂ → x
Momentum: p̂ = -iℏ∇
Energy: Ê = iℏ∂/∂t
Kinetic: T̂ = p̂²/(2m)
Hamiltonian: Ĥ = T̂ + V̂</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Commutation Relations</h3>
        <pre><code>[x̂, p̂] = iℏ (canonical)
[Ĥ, t̂] = iℏ
[Ĵ_x, Ĵ_y] = iℏĴ_z (angular momentum)</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Measurement</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Measurement Postulate</h3>
        <pre><code>Measuring observable Â gives eigenvalue a_n
Probability: P(a_n) = |⟨a_n|ψ⟩|²
After measurement: |ψ⟩ → |a_n⟩
Expectation: ⟨Â⟩ = ⟨ψ|Â|ψ⟩</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Uncertainty Principle</h3>
        <pre><code>ΔA·ΔB ≥ ½|⟨[Â, B̂]⟩|
Δx·Δp ≥ ℏ/2
ΔE·Δt ≥ ℏ/2</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Dirac Notation</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Bra-Ket</h3>
        <pre><code>|ψ⟩: ket (state vector)
⟨ψ|: bra (dual vector)
⟨φ|ψ⟩: inner product
|φ⟩⟨ψ|: outer product
Completeness: Σ|n⟩⟨n| = 1</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
